# Workspace Venv Sync
RULE: When adding deps to pyproject.toml, install at BOTH repo and workspace venv levels for IDE health.
DO: Repo: `cd repo && uv pip install -e ".[dev]"`. Workspace: `source .venv-workspace/bin/activate && uv pip install -e <repo>`
Install order for execution libs: matching-engine-library → unified-trade-execution-interface → unified-defi-execution-interface → execution-algo-library → execution-service.
NEVER: Absolute paths in docs (see codex-no-absolute-paths.mdc).
